SUMMARY:Bonsai How To Class
DESCRIPTION:Bonsai Bar is a night of fun at a local venue near you that you don’t want to miss! Beginner workshops are perfect for you to learn everything you need to know to walk away with your very own tiny tree. So grab a friend\, your beverage of choice\, and get ready for a great 2 hours of everything bonsai.  \nhttps://bonsaibar.com/pages/workshops
